     &mo FN      &kp GRAVE   &kp CAPS     &kp LEFT   &kp RIGHT                  &bs_del     &mo NAV     &kp END      &kp PG_DN  &lt NUM RET &lt_spc NAV 0                &kp UP     &kp DOWN    &kp LBKT    &kp RBKT    &mo FN
